From 58d190bf45688687244e3ca358027f87210b3920 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 13:27:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 152/152] reaper v1.5.0c: SPDX license headers on Reaper source
 + font OFL license

Compliance hygiene (no functional change), from the 2026-07-13 audit:
- Add SPDX-License-Identifier GPL-2.0-only + copyright headers to the
  Reaper-authored source files (rtrafd, rmcpd, reaper_inject, the QoS/Traffic/
  Advisor/dashboard/shell pages, reaper CSS, the two Makefiles).
- Install the SIL Open Font License 1.1 text as www/fonts/OFL.txt so the
  license for the bundled Inter/Rajdhani web fonts travels in the flashed
  image (OFL 1.1 requires the notice to accompany the fonts).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
